        <li><a href="https://www.swift.com/sites/default/files/files/pmpg-hybrid-postal-address-v1.12-05mar2026.pdf" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Hybrid Postal Address, Version 1.12</a> &mdash; Payments Market Practice Group (PMPG), 5 March 2026.</li>
